import json,html,xml.etree.ElementTree as E
from pathlib import Path
root=Path('.');lib=json.loads((root/'app/src/main/assets/drawchemistry/library.json').read_text())
rows=[
('1 · Integration','Implemented','Independent drawchemistry package; home dashboard card; DrawChemistry navigation route; own Room database; existing modules preserved.'),
('2 · UI','Portrait and landscape verified','Reference-style snow-white controls, blue Save pill, rounded search, vector icon tabs, floating drawing tools, skeletal canvas, vertical element rail, ring presets, shaded molecule thumbnails, categorized two-column library and source property sheets. System-bar appearance uses inset controllers and white edge-to-edge surfaces. Unlocked-device UI tests and screenshots verify portrait and landscape layouts. The landscape search field is collapsible; drawing and 3D tool panels use compact horizontal rows. Restored drawings fit the resized canvas. Exhaustive small-screen and font-scale combinations remain untested.'),
('3 · 2D editing','Core implemented; advanced features partial','All 118 elements; replacement, charge, isotope, hydrogen count, display aliases, mapping, single/double/triple, wedge/dash, dative/query annotations; atom/bond hit testing; bond geometry, rings 3–8, nine aromatic/heterocyclic templates; select, lasso, drag, erase, pan/zoom, undo/redo, fragment copy/paste. Arbitrary fusion/bridging, chemical R/query atoms, radicals, lone-pair semantics and general stereochemical re-assignment are not implemented. Unedited source stereochemistry survives tested molecular round trips; structural edits require stereo review.'),
('4 · 3D','Reference-coordinate viewer implemented; builder incomplete','OpenGL ES 2 cached shaded sphere/cylinder meshes; ball/stick, space-filling, sticks and wireframe; rotation, pinch, pan, axis-oriented cameras, zoom slider, focus view, atom selection, H toggle, reset and distance/angle/dihedral. PubChem computed conformers only. No offline conformer generation, force-field optimization, conformer ranking, polyhedra, surfaces, protein ribbon, torsion editing, auto-rotation, axis overlays or 3D atom creation. Structural changes discard old conformers and properties.'),
('5 · Library','26 unique bundled source records','Exactly 26 PubChem compounds, with 25 available 3D conformers, including benzoic acid CID 243. Sodium chloride is kept as charged ions without a fabricated conformation. The requested thousands-compound curated library is not delivered. Categories cover basic chemistry, hydrocarbons, functional groups, biomolecules and pharmaceuticals.'),
('6 · Online data','Implemented; subset device-tested','PubChem name/IUPAC, CID, formula and SMILES lookup; result pages of 10, cap 100; graph/properties/conformer retrieval; asynchronous HTTP, bounded reads, retries, serialized requests and local caching. Ethanol name lookup and record cache executed successfully on physical device. Each lookup mode has not yet received full end-to-end device acceptance. No RCSB/NIST runtime integration.'),
('7 · Validation','Limited supported-rule engine','Graph integrity, duplicate bonds/IDs, coordinate checks and common-element valence warnings; CDK atom typing/hydrogen assignment, formula/molar mass, 2D cleanup, add/remove H, nine functional-group SMARTS patterns. Explicit warning for metals/uncommon states and coordinate/query bonds. Not a complete organometallic/aromaticity/stereochemical validity certificate; no similarity search service.'),
('8 · Reactions','Seven editable educational templates','Addition, substitution, elimination, hydrogenation, esterification, hydrolysis and neutralization. Actual editable molecular graphs, plus signs, arrows/equilibrium arrows, conditions, editable annotations and atom mapping numbers. Atom inventories are regression-tested. No mechanism simulation, general reaction parser, polymer repeat-unit engine or automated multistep arrangement.'),
('9 · Measurements','Implemented subset','Computed-coordinate distances in angstroms, angles and dihedrals in degrees, coordinate inspection and SMARTS group highlighting. No orbital/density calculations, hydrogen-bond inference, automated VSEPR/polarity interpretation, split molecule comparison or advanced electronic properties.'),
('10 · Persistence & files','Core implemented; format limits explicit','Room draft autosave/recovery, save-as-new, duplicate, favorites, recent personal list and search. JSON project, SMILES and MOL/SDF V2000 first-record imports; project/SMILES/MOL/2D SDF and source-coordinate 3D SDF exports; SVG/PNG drawing exports and one-way XYZ coordinate export. JSON/SMILES/MOL round trips regression-tested. No MOL2/PDB/mmCIF/V3000 parsers, multi-record SDF library import, collections or rename-in-place. SVG/PNG are image exports, not molecular round trips. Reaction scenes export as JSON/SVG/PNG only.'),
('11 · Android performance','Engineering implemented; measurements pending','Bounded 500-atom graph, 100-operation undo, 2 MB imports/network limits; background chemistry/network, render-on-demand GLES, native 2D canvas, resource release, saved state and separate Room store. No automatic motion. Physical-device offscreen GLES sample: 120 caffeine frames at 640×640, render plus glFinish median 1.764 ms / p95 2.897 ms. This is not on-screen FPS; activity recreation, foreground/background recovery and rotation tests passed. Complete on-screen FPS, latency and memory/leak acceptance remain pending.'),
('12 · Physical device','Eight physical-device tests passed','Authorized OnePlus CPH2717, Android 16, ADB wireless transport adb-Q8G6ZLF6NR69Q85D-vvvTJj._adb-tls-connect._tcp. Five physical-device core tests passed: bundled-data/formula/conformer checks, database, live PubChem/cache, native 2D touch/PNG/SVG and actual GLES conformer rendering/style/H toggle/120-frame rotations. After unlocking, three visible UI tests cover: drawing/undo/redo/save/library/styles/H toggling and the real home-card route with 3D drag gestures, activity recreation, background recovery, landscape search/tool visibility and return navigation. Eight tests cover the core engine and visible UI workflows, including all four reference layouts and benzoic-acid source properties. Actual portrait/landscape screenshots were captured. This verifies the listed workflows, not every scenario in the master specification.'),
('13 · Automated tests','100 unit tests passed','18 new regression tests plus 82 existing tests, including a source-coordinate 3D SDF export test. Covers formula/mass, stereochemical and isotope molecular round trips, graph/JSON safety, history, ring connectivity, coordinate transforms, measurements, balanced schemes, functional groups and the Android segment intersection replacement. Device test suite source includes data/cache/database, native touch/render and visible editor workflows.'),
('14 · Delivery','Core module delivered; full specification incomplete','Debug APK built and installed. Debug APK and unsigned release AAB builds passed (release signing is not configured; no Play upload was performed). Five core and three visible UI physical-device tests passed together after the landscape overlap and canvas fitting fixes. See the companion logs and actual on-screen captures. Advanced unsupported capabilities and exhaustive performance/format/accessibility acceptance are not complete.')]
style='body{font:16px/1.55 system-ui;color:#19334a;background:#f4f8fc;margin:0}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:28px}section,details{background:white;border:1px solid #dbe5ef;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin:16px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #e2eaf1;padding:9px}small{color:#58748c}a{color:#0876bf}'
parts=[f'<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>Draw Chemistry delivery audit</title><style>{style}</style><main><h1>Draw Chemistry — implementation audit</h1><p>18 October 2026 · Native Android module · Explicit capability and verification boundaries</p><section><h2>Delivery status</h2><p>A functional core editor and a home-screen card have been added. The complete 14-phase professional chemistry workstation specification is <b>not complete</b>. Unsupported advanced functions are documented rather than represented by fake controls or fabricated chemistry.</p><p>Source: app/src/main/java/com/indianservers/aichemistryexplorer/drawchemistry/ · Navigation: Screen.DrawChemistry in MainActivity.kt · Persistence: draw-chemistry.db (Room v1).</p></section>']
for title,status,body in rows:parts.append(f'<details open><summary>{html.escape(title)} — {html.escape(status)}</summary><p>{html.escape(body)}</p></details>')
parts.append('<section><h2>Bundled source records</h2><table><tr><th>Compound</th><th>PubChem CID</th><th>3D model</th><th>Source formula</th></tr>')
for e in lib:
 d=json.loads((root/f'app/src/main/assets/drawchemistry/{e["cid"]}.json').read_text());formula=next(p['value']['sval'] for p in d['two']['props'] if p['urn']['label']=='Molecular Formula')
 parts.append(f'<tr><td>{html.escape(e["name"])}</td><td><a href="https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/{e["cid"]}">{e["cid"]}</a></td><td>{"Computed conformer" if d["three"] else "Unavailable"}</td><td>{html.escape(formula)}</td></tr>')
parts.append('</table><h3>Actual physical-device renderer captures (offscreen)</h3><p>These exercise the production native renderers; they are not full app-screen screenshots.</p><img src="draw-chemistry-native-canvas.png" alt="Physical-device native canvas water drawing" style="max-width:260px"><img src="draw-chemistry-gles-caffeine.png" alt="Physical-device GLES caffeine conformer render" style="max-width:400px"><p>Retrieved 2026-10-18. Properties and computed coordinates retain PubChem provenance; they are not labeled experimental.</p></section><section><h2>Reference UI redesign</h2><p><a href="draw-chemistry-ui-preview.html">Open the four-screen device preview</a></p><p>Vector controls, thumbnail previews and interactive shaded molecular meshes are native UI and source-coordinate renderers. Unsupported molecular surfaces are represented by the supported Wireframe option; missing spectra/safety values are identified without fabricated records. Properties use actual PubChem identifiers, rather than copying unverified CAS or external database IDs from the reference image.</p><h2>Visible Android UI verification</h2><p>Home card navigation, saving, 3D drag gestures, recreation, background recovery and landscape controls passed on the unlocked physical phone.</p><img src="draw-chemistry-portrait-3d.png" alt="Actual portrait UI" style="max-width:260px"><img src="draw-chemistry-landscape-3d.png" alt="Actual landscape 3D UI after compact layout fix" style="max-width:100%"><img src="draw-chemistry-landscape-2d.png" alt="Actual landscape drawing tools" style="max-width:100%"></section><section><h2>Toolkit and licensing</h2><p>CDK 2.13 under LGPL-2.1-or-later is used for actual molecular parsing, hydrogen assignment, SMARTS and 2D layout. A narrowly patched LayoutRefiner removes its desktop AWT intersection dependency. Modified source, full upstream SDG source, license and rebuild script are distributed in app assets/CDK-ANDROID-SOURCE.zip and third_party/cdk-android. No desktop AWT warning is suppressed.</p><p>Native Canvas and GLES avoid WebView editing/runtime dependencies. RDKit force-field generation is not integrated; PubChem retrieval is the explicit supported 3D route. Ketcher/Jmol were not added as untested browser engines.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/cdk/cdk/tree/cdk-2.13">CDK source</a> · <a href="https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/docs/pug-rest">PubChem PUG REST</a> · <a href="https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/docs/copyright">PubChem reuse information</a></p></section></main></html>')
(root/'outputs/draw-chemistry-audit.html').write_text(''.join(parts),encoding='utf-8')
